Find the area and the perimeter of this rectangle, each in simplest form.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}
\coordinate (A) at (0,0);
\coordinate (B) at (4.157,0);
\coordinate (C) at (4.157,3.118);
\coordinate (D) at (0,3.118);
\draw (A) -- (B) node[midway,below] {$2\sqrt{12}\text{ m}$};
\draw (B) -- (C);
\draw (C) -- (D);
\draw (D) -- (A) node[midway,left] {$\sqrt{27}\text{ m}$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
